# Atlas Core Component Token Specification & Boundary Fallbacks
**Author:** Jax Adeyemi  
**Department:** Design  
**Project:** Atlas Core  
**Produced:** D19 07:40  
**Inputs used:** Business Document (Company Document)  
## Summary

Component token definition dictionary for Atlas Core, mapping micro-interactions, high-contrast physical/digital ergonomic states, and boundary fallback tokens derived from Business Document: Company Document.

